"where :math:`\\forall_{n_{cp}}` is the total volume of the core particles in"
" the floc. The buoyant density is the parameter of interest when calculating"
" terminal velocity and thus Equation :eq:`floc_mass_conservation` can be "
"rewritten as"
msgstr ""
